      },
      "message": "feat: add auto-merge, TUI PR creation, CI/review status columns (#47)\n\n- MCP server: create_pr() now enables GitHub auto-merge via\n  `gh pr merge --auto --squash` after creating PRs\n- TUI: Complete `p` keybinding to create PRs with auto-merge\n- TUI: Add `u` keybinding to rebase all workers onto main\n- TUI: Add CI and Review status columns with 30s caching\n- Skills: Update worker and issue-worker to enable auto-merge\n\nAuto-merge requires GitHub branch protection with required status checks.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
